{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa and Sally Plan a Party"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "You Are Invited"}, {"type": "position", "content": 1}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 16}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking About Future Actions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can use four different tenses to talk about the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>When you talk about a things that are not decided or when you make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future, you use the modal will.</li>  <li>When you ask about intentions, you use going to.</li>  <li>When you talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future, you use the Present Continuous tense.</li>  <li>When you talk about schedules or timetables in the future, you use the Simple Present tense </li></ul>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Will</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I'll take care of the invites.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Going to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"When are we going to have that party?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Continuous</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Marco is coming to the party.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Simple Present tense</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I have a couple of VIP guests at the restaurant next week.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Respond Politely to Suggestions and Offers"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the modals <span class=\"italic\">could</span>, <span class=\"italic\">should</span> or <span class=\"italic\">might</span> to suggest something.  When someone offers suggestions, it is important to respond politely."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Here is a list of expressions you can use to give suggestions: <ul><li>You might want to \u2026</li><li> Would you mind \u2026 ?</li><li> You should \u2026</li><li> You ought to \u2026 (strong request)</li></ul>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Offering Suggestions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responding to Offers and Suggestions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>You might want to \u2026</li><li> Would you mind \u2026 ?</li><li> You should \u2026</li><li> You ought to \u2026 (strong request)</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>I don't think I can \u2026</li><li> I guess that could ...</li><li> That would be ...</li>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Ann: How about we have a party next week? "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Yes, I guess that could work"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm thinking a dozen guests, maybe"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Maybe 6 or 8 would be just enough to have a good conversation"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "VIP "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "Very Important Person; an important guest "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have a few VIP guests coming next week."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob01aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you plan a party."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to whip up "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to prepare; to put something together "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'll whip up something amazing for tomorrow's party."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob01aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to notify "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to let someone know about something "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'll notify everyone tomorrow."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob01aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to be a handful "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to be difficult to handle "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: These VIP guests are a handful ..."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob01aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to get the idea "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to understand "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: So your guests are a handful? I get the idea ..."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob01aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "proper "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "correct; adequate "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Six to eight guests would be ideal for a proper conversation."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob01aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to sustain "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to support; to carry "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: 4 or 5 guests would be just enough to sustain a proper conversation."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob0