, I can also whip up something decent ... <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You're in charge of the menu. I'll take care of the invites. Is Marco going to be there?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yeah, I guess he's coming ... We're going through a rough patch right now, but we're trying to sort things out. I'm sure Deanna and Michael will want to come as well. I'll notify them tomorrow."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "audio", "value": "engenn6le16ob01re3aud01"}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "text", "id": 2, "_data": []}]}]}